On an administrator workstation (Director Akikawa in this case)

Run Powershell in admin

netsh interface ipv4 set address name="Ethernet0" source=dhcp
netsh interface ipv4 set dnsservers name="Ethernet0" source=dhcp

ipconfig /release
ipconfig /renew
ipconfig /all

